        'The third transversal is (nearly) parallel to the ray through P₁ and Q₁, so their meeting point R₁ runs off the figure. In the cross-ratio the two factors containing R₁ both blow up at the same rate and cancel, leaving |R₂R₄|/|R₂R₃| — the same invariant value.');
